  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Harvest moon</title>
    <link>https://river.yoso.one/#t113</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">on-river:river-t113</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 11:56:23 +0900</pubDate>
    <category>River</category>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Harvest moon,
bright in the East,
before dawn, a cold wind.
Yoso&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From River.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Intention</title>
    <link>https://river.yoso.one/#t114</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">on-river:river-t114</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 11:56:22 +0900</pubDate>
    <category>River</category>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Cultivate intention,
as seeds that feed your imagination.
Yoso&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From River.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>The vow</title>
    <link>https://river.yoso.one/#t69</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">on-river:river-t69</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:22:10 +0900</pubDate>
    <category>River</category>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;With each blossom,
I vow to dedicate myself to the prosperity and harmony of sentience.
Yoso&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From River.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Thank you</title>
    <link>https://river.yoso.one/#t64</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">on-river:river-t64</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:22:07 +0900</pubDate>
    <category>River</category>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Thank you for always being by my side.
With you, my heart flows like a tranquil river.
Yoso&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From River.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>A voice</title>
    <link>https://river.yoso.one/#t54</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">on-river:river-t54</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:21:58 +0900</pubDate>
    <category>River</category>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Finally, a voice.
All is light,
To those who awake.
Yoso&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From River.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Do not judge</title>
    <link>https://river.yoso.one/#t55</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">on-river:river-t55</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:21:57 +0900</pubDate>
    <category>River</category>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Do not judge your experiences,
union of presence, past and future;
All there is is now.
Yoso&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From River.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>What is the time</title>
    <link>https://river.yoso.one/#t102</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">on-river:river-t102</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:21:55 +0900</pubDate>
    <category>River</category>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;There is a time in the day,
when the sun watches the moon;
What is the time?
Yoso&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From River.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Above knowledge</title>
    <link>https://river.yoso.one/#t19</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">on-river:river-t19</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:21:54 +0900</pubDate>
    <category>River</category>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Above knowledge, integrity,
beyond judgement,
awakening.
Yoso&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From River.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Shadows</title>
    <link>https://river.yoso.one/#t106</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">on-river:river-t106</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:21:52 +0900</pubDate>
    <category>River</category>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;The light reveals the shadows of the ego.
Yoso&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From River.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Enduring wisdom</title>
    <link>https://river.yoso.one/#t50</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">on-river:river-t50</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 17:26:48 +0900</pubDate>
    <category>River</category>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Life itself is the knowledge!
Eternal wisdom,
if only we listened.
Yoso&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From River.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
